    {
      "id": "claim_601cf1be76924023a42b53fd13b063ba",
      "statement": "/v1/register/challenge is additionally tolerated as an alias of the register-completion handler alongside /v1/register/complete and the legacy /register/complete, and /health advertises the canonical completion route in api.completion_route so clients can discover which alias this server accepts.",
