    {
      "id": "claim_47f81216b9b64512894fa653ba544200",
      "statement": "GET /agents/{fp} (legacy, no /v1 prefix) serializes the agent's bare manifest — data['manifest'] — where /v1/agents/{fp} returns the full {manifest, trust} object, and both surfaces share the same AGENT_NOT_FOUND (never registered) and AGENT_NOT_LISTED (suspended or expired) 404 errors from the service layer.",
