      "id": "claim_ba6d7564eb9840c1979a36978fd6f889",
      "statement": "The legacy response bodies are governed by an additive-only rule: legacy aliases return the same bodies as the reference plus additive fields (directory_fingerprint where the reference lacked it), and fields the unmodified client reads — challenge_nonce, status 'registered', the bare-manifest results list — must never be removed or renamed; SPEC §4.9 states this as 'additive fields only, never removed'.",
