    {
      "id": "claim_ddbecd4b7b4c440f8f050dfa084b70bb",
      "statement": "The compat test tests/test_compat_client.py locates the real unmodified client package via the HAAP_REPO env var first and the sibling ../haap checkout second, validating the candidate by the presence of haap/registry_client.py, and skips the whole module at collection with an explicit reason ('companion haap client package not found (set HAAP_REPO or place ../haap)') when neither exists; when found the module inserts the companion repo on sys.path and runs the genuine client imports.",
