    {
      "id": "claim_a9be982c5a504fb5a7a67943f7674c0f",
      "statement": "test_unmodified_client_register_search_heartbeat exercises the end-to-end wire contract by running the unmodified haap.identity.IdentityStore and haap.registry_client register, heartbeat and search against a real directory on an ephemeral port (the shared running fixture): registration completes with status 'registered', the unsigned heartbeat returns True, and both capability and free-text search return exactly one bare manifest whose agent.fingerprint and agent.endpoint match — jointly proving byte-level canonical serialization parity and legacy wire compatibility.",
